# BaseITcore

## Global GPO Search
Search across all GPO settings, registry keys, and configurations.

An advanced dashboard for querying, visualizing, and analyzing GPO data across your organization.

## Features
- Powerful search engine for GPOs
- Filter by user, computer, settings, preferences, security
- Real-time error display (e.g. 404 feedback)
- User-friendly UI with left sidebar and dynamic search results

